{"title":"2002 Pan African MO Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_Pan_African_MO_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Prove for every integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/4/0247db3d702b5ce6be98f50771750a2723cddcea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n&gt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"43\" height=\"13\" />, there exists an integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/e/67e6630318d8cb28de2723180b6d359b972489c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k&gt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"43\" height=\"13\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/6/1e67d8ddd7e8af166baa89efc2785d1876dee970.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^nk$\" width=\"27\" height=\"12\" /> can be written in decimal notation using only digits 1 and 2.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_Pan_African_MO_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can use <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Induction\" title=\"Induction\">induction</a> to solve the problem.  For the base case, note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edf074831eb5bc9e61d6d6e09f525a86e3068f6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> is divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/3/dd3907e89ce5b06f13d78589b5d92624a8b41a7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$112$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" /> is divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/4/ae45cb229cb8ff6724f23f8d688e220343ed72b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2112$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" /> is divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/5/9a5b4928c8fe50ce3c2428da3bee3505e891b788.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p><br />\nNow assume that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/8/22852d79cd9b873e7ee1d84c87ae8ebcb48a2f85.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\equiv 0 \\pmod{2^{n-1}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"140\" height=\"19\" />.  That means <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/f/d0f85dffa6b87a7ffb9fcc5174af51de55fafb05.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 2^{n-1}k$\" width=\"79\" height=\"15\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> is an integer.  Multiply both sides by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/e/bdeb6244470c258474c19cd0d100043b3944e5a4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x = 2^n k$\" width=\"71\" height=\"12\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/4/214b6c4e049450f5fbe2d83dd473d05777e8e444.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\tfrac12 \\cdot 2^n k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"86\" height=\"21\" />.  That means <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/3/0d3b8a9514a15168e72d97301008078aa3a8c3ae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\equiv \\tfrac12 \\cdot 2^n \\pmod{2^n}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"156\" height=\"21\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/1/3713541ffcbab2e833a0510d216068d547941394.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\equiv 0 \\pmod{2^n}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"123\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p><br />\nAdditionally, from above, note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/4/fe400e1f642355b353a85e8a117e449573856a84.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10^{n-1} \\equiv \\tfrac12 \\cdot 2^n \\pmod{2^n}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"190\" height=\"21\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/0/140aeba0c2143858451de41d8020b9c6601d24b0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 \\cdot 10^{n-1} \\equiv 0 \\pmod{2^n}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"179\" height=\"19\" />.  Thus, if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/3/0d3b8a9514a15168e72d97301008078aa3a8c3ae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\equiv \\tfrac12 \\cdot 2^n \\pmod{2^n}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"156\" height=\"21\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/c/4ace1159d9064b748c3b16beda7ff2679a63cb82.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + 10^{n-1} \\equiv 2 \\cdot \\tfrac12 \\cdot 2^n \\equiv 0 \\pmod{2^n}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"278\" height=\"21\" />, and if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/1/3713541ffcbab2e833a0510d216068d547941394.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\equiv 0 \\pmod{2^n}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"123\" height=\"18\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/d/2bda784fe526a3f58e2e1aad272824e1fddff09c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + 2 \\cdot 10^{n-1} \\equiv 0 \\pmod{2^n}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"212\" height=\"19\" />.  Therefore, it is possible to write a number with only digits 1 and 2 that is divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/3/6c36f0b157e8c2fbe0638c2f2b378e08d07695aa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^n$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" />, so there exists a positive integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/6/1e67d8ddd7e8af166baa89efc2785d1876dee970.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^nk$\" width=\"27\" height=\"12\" /> can be written in decimal notation using only digits 1 and 2.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_Pan_African_MO_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_Pan_African_MO\" title=\"2002 Pan African MO\">2002 Pan African MO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_Pan_African_MO_Problems\" title=\"2002 Pan African MO Problems\">Problems</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_Pan_African_MO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2002 Pan African MO Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"34%\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_Pan_African_MO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2002 Pan African MO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_Pan_African_MO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2002 Pan African MO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_Pan_African_MO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2002 Pan African MO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_Pan_African_MO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2002 Pan African MO Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_Pan_African_MO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2002 Pan African MO Problems/Problem 6\">6</a>\n</td>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_Pan_African_MO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2002 Pan African MO Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Pan_African_MO_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"Pan African MO Problems and Solutions\"> All Pan African MO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017201147\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.022 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.034 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 176/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 962/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 44/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 5043/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.629      1 Template:Pan_African_MO_box\n100.00%    6.629      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:17937:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 202610